CHAPTER.VERS:
For the LORD thy God 
        bringeth thee into a good 
        land, a land of brooks of water, of fountains and depths that spring out of valleys and hills;

A land of wheat, and barley, and vines, and fig trees, and pomegranates; a land of olive 
        oil, and honey; 

          of oil…: Heb. of olive tree of oil
